0,Tai Laing language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tai_Laing_language,"Tai Laing, also known as Shan-Ni, is a Tai language of Burma, closely related to Khamti and Shan. It is written in its own variant of Burmese script, and though not taught in schools, is experiencing a cultural revival, albeit still small.",Tai Laing,Kra-Dai
